== Part 1: Al-Biruni's Indology & Epistemological Barriers (Q1 to Q5)

#mcq(1, [In which language did the eleventh-century scholar Al-Biruni compose his monumental encyclopedic treatise, the Kitab al-Hind?], (
  [Persian],
  [Sanskrit],
